IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbca-core`

-- Canada Business Corporations Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. C-44), PART XIV.1 -- Disclosure Relating to Diversity (s 172.1).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL. The text this was encoded from is a plain-text rendering of the Department of Justice
-- Canada consolidation current to 2026-09-30 (last amended 2026-03-26); it is not an official version,
-- and nothing here has been verified against the official text. Contains information licensed under
-- the Open Government Licence - Canada.
--
-- LAYER 1: the law, objectively. Rules are named `<what> within s N`. Every figure the regulations
-- supply ("prescribed corporation", "prescribed information", "senior management as defined by
-- regulation") is a plain input: the regulations are not among the sources.
-- Dates: Part XIV.1 holds no enactment, assent or commencement provision, so no date is carried.

§ `Part XIV.1 -- Disclosure Relating to Diversity`

§§ `s 172.1(1) -- the directors place the information before the shareholders`

-- "prescribed corporation": the regulations say which corporations (not a source: a plain input).
-- "at every annual meeting": the duty arises at an annual meeting, not at a special meeting.
-- The relation: the directors owe the shareholders the information at the annual meeting.
-- src:2089 | Diversity in corporations
-- src:2090 | 172.1 (1) The directors of a prescribed corporation shall place before the shareholders, at every annual meeting, the prescribed information respecting diversity among the directors and among the members of senior management as defined by regulation.
@ref CBCA s 172.1(1) (src:2089-2090)
GIVEN `the corporation is a prescribed corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the meeting is an annual meeting of shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the directors must place the diversity information before the shareholders within s 172.1(1)` MEANS
        `the corporation is a prescribed corporation`
    AND `the meeting is an annual meeting of shareholders`

-- Whether the directors have done what (1) asks: the duty arises, and then both halves of the
-- information are placed: the prescribed information about diversity among the directors, and
-- the prescribed information about diversity among the members of senior management (as the
-- regulations define senior management). If the duty does not arise the directors have nothing to do,
-- so they are not in default.
@ref CBCA s 172.1(1) (src:2090)
GIVEN `the corporation is a prescribed corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the meeting is an annual meeting of shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the prescribed information about diversity among the directors was placed before the shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the prescribed information about diversity among the members of senior management was placed before the shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the directors have complied with s 172.1(1)` MEANS
        `the directors must place the diversity information before the shareholders within s 172.1(1)`
            `the corporation is a prescribed corporation` `the meeting is an annual meeting of shareholders`
    IMPLIES
            (    `the prescribed information about diversity among the directors was placed before the shareholders`
             AND `the prescribed information about diversity among the members of senior management was placed before the shareholders`)

§§ `s 172.1(2) -- the information goes to each shareholder`

-- The relation: the corporation owes each shareholder the information, except a shareholder who has
-- informed the corporation in writing that they do not want it; that shareholder's claim is gone.
-- The manner: sent along with the notice of the meeting under s 135(1), or made available along with a
-- proxy circular under s 150(1): either manner is enough ("or").
-- src:2091 | Information to shareholders and Director
-- src:2092 | (2) The corporation shall provide the information referred to in subsection (1) to each shareholder, except to a shareholder who has informed the corporation in writing that they do not want to receive that information, by sending the information along with the notice referred to in subsection 135(1) or by making the information available along with a proxy circular referred to in subsection 150(1).
@ref CBCA s 172.1(2) (src:2091-2092)
GIVEN `the corporation is a prescribed corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder has informed the corporation in writing that they do not want to receive the information` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the corporation must provide the diversity information to a shareholder within s 172.1(2)` MEANS
        `the corporation is a prescribed corporation`
    AND (NOT `the shareholder has informed the corporation in writing that they do not want to receive the information`)

@ref CBCA s 172.1(2) (src:2092)
GIVEN `the information was sent along with the notice referred to in subsection 135(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information was made available along with a proxy circular referred to in subsection 150(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the information was provided in a manner the section allows within s 172.1(2)` MEANS
        `the information was sent along with the notice referred to in subsection 135(1)`
    OR  `the information was made available along with a proxy circular referred to in subsection 150(1)`

§§ `s 172.1(3) -- the information goes to the Director`

-- The Director (an official) is owed the information; the duty is the corporation's. "Concurrently" is
-- read as: on the same day as the information is provided to the shareholders under subsection (2)
-- (fork F-CONC in NOTES.md). No exception for a shareholder who has opted out: the Director is always
-- sent it if the corporation is a prescribed corporation.
-- src:2093 | Information to Director
-- src:2094 | (3) The corporation shall concurrently send the information referred to in subsection (1) to the Director.
@ref CBCA s 172.1(3) (src:2093-2094)
GIVEN `the corporation is a prescribed corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the corporation must send the diversity information to the Director within s 172.1(3)` MEANS
    `the corporation is a prescribed corporation`

@ref CBCA s 172.1(3) (src:2094)
GIVEN `the date the information was provided to the shareholders` IS A DATE
      `the date the information was sent to the Director` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the information was sent to the Director concurrently within s 172.1(3)` MEANS
    `the date the information was sent to the Director` EQUALS `the date the information was provided to the shareholders`
